OL,3,CColombia earthquake: At least 132
OL,4,Cpeople dead as national emergency
OL,5,Cdeclared
OL,7,FA baby was pulled from the rubble
OL,8,Fafter a major 7.4 magnitude earthquake
OL,9,Fhit Colombia on Monday, killing at
OL,10,Fleast 132 people
OL,12,FCredit: CCTV (via APTN)
OL,14,FThe death toll from an earthquake in
OL,15,FColombia has risen to at least 132,
OL,16,Fwith hundreds more injured, and
OL,17,Fthousands more missing, the Colombian
OL,18,FAssociation of Capital Cities has said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
