OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786463298
OL,3,CColombia earthquake: At least 132
OL,4,Cpeople dead as national emergency
OL,5,Cdeclared
OL,7,FThe powerful 7.4 magnitude quake
OL,8,Fstruck western Colombia on Monday
OL,9,Fmorning, rattling multiple cities and
OL,10,Fdamaging around 1,600 buildings.
OL,12,FMore than 570 people are injured and
OL,13,Fmany continue to be trapped under
OL,14,Frubble as rescue efforts continue
OL,15,Facross the country.
OL,17,FVideo showed an infant being pulled
OL,18,Fout of a collapsed building.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
