OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786463298
OL,3,CColombia earthquake: At least 132
OL,4,Cpeople dead as national emergency
OL,5,Cdeclared
OL,7,FBy Monday night, more than 2,700
OL,8,Fpeople had been reported missing by
OL,9,Ffamilies on citizen-run websites.
OL,11,FPresident Abelardo de la Espriella
OL,12,Fdeclared a national emergency, calling
OL,13,Ffor funding and support.
OL,15,FThe earthquake struck at 07:34 local
OL,16,Ftime. Its epicenter was near San Jose
OL,17,Fdel Palmar, in the department of
OL,18,FChoco, at a depth of 96 km, the
OL,19,FColombian Geological Service confirmed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
