OL,3,CColombia earthquake: At least 132
OL,4,Cpeople dead as national emergency
OL,5,Cdeclared
OL,7,FAccording to the preliminary report,
OL,8,F32 cities across the country have been
OL,9,Fseriously affected, while five
OL,10,Fdepartmental capitals, Pereira, Cali,
OL,11,FQuibdo, Manizales and Armenia, remain
OL,12,Funder red alert.
OL,14,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,19,FThe quake was even felt in fellow
OL,20,FSouth American countries Ecuador and
OL,21,FPanama.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
