OL,3,CColombia earthquake: At least 132
OL,4,Cpeople dead as national emergency
OL,5,Cdeclared
OL,7,FSoldiers, rescue personnel and
OL,8,Ffamilies worked throughout the day and
OL,9,Fnight to pick through the rubble,
OL,10,Fremoving and passing large pieces of
OL,11,Fconcrete by hand down lines of
OL,12,Fvolunteers.
OL,14,FVenezuela's acting President Delcy
OL,15,FRodriguez on Monday offered
OL,16,Fhumanitarian aid and rescue teams to
OL,17,Fits neighbours in Colombia.
OL,26,@wD@Ert
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
