OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786463298
OL,3,CColombia earthquake: At least 132
OL,4,Cpeople dead as national emergency
OL,5,Cdeclared
OL,7,FVenezuela faced two back-to-back
OL,8,Fearthquakes in June, with a magnitude
OL,9,Fof 7.2 and 7.5, which destroyed
OL,10,Fhundreds of buildings and killed more
OL,11,Fthan 6,300 people.
OL,13,FMs Rodriguez said: "We know how
OL,14,Fpainful this can be. And from here, we
OL,15,Fextend our condolences to the families
OL,16,Fwho have lost loved ones and friends,
OL,17,Fthe condolences of the people of
OL,18,FVenezuela and our deepest solidarity.
OL,26,@uD@Hrt
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
