OL,3,CColombia earthquake: At least 132
OL,4,Cpeople dead as national emergency
OL,5,Cdeclared
OL,7,F"You are not alone. I have witnessed
OL,8,Fthe solidarity of the peoples of Latin
OL,9,FAmerica, the Caribbean, and the world,
OL,10,Fwho have expressed their support for
OL,11,Four sister nation, Colombia."
OL,13,FThe US State Department announced it
OL,14,Fwould provide $15.5 million (#11.5
OL,15,Fmillion) for emergency shelter, food
OL,16,Fand other aid.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
